{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.ParticleInteractions.branching_qvalue_factorization","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.branching_qvalue_factorization","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.branching_qvalue_factorization","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.branching_qvalue_factorization","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/branching_qvalue_factorization.lean#L93-L106","doc":"**Branching Q-value factorisation** ([`prop:branching-qvalue-factorization`]):\n`Σ Δm_e = a^Z · b^{N−1} · (a − b)`.  Derived sorry-free from the config-sum\nmultiplicativity reduction and elementary algebra (`0 < N`). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:branching-qvalue-factorization","label":"prop:branching-qvalue-factorization","md":"quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/branching-qvalue-factorization.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.totalDeltaM","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.totalDeltaM","kind":"def","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/branching_qvalue_factorization.lean#L85-L91","doc":"**Total `Σ Δm_e`** over all `4^A` configurations: the daughter\n`(Z+1, N−1)` channel product minus the parent `(Z, N)` channel product.\nA concrete `def` (not an abstract field), so the factorisation below is\nnon-vacuous. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.configSum_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.configSum_eq","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/branching_qvalue_factorization.lean#L76-L83","doc":"**Config-sum multiplicativity reduction** — the genuine combinatorial\ncontent.  By nucleon independence (`Finset.prod_univ_sum`), the `4^P`\nconfig sum collapses to the per-slot channel sum raised to the `P`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.configSum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.configSum","kind":"def","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/branching_qvalue_factorization.lean#L70-L74","doc":"**Config sum**: over all `4^P` channel assignments of `P` slots, the sum\nof the products of per-slot channel weights. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BranchingChannels.b","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BranchingChannels.b","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/branching_qvalue_factorization.lean#L65-L66","doc":"Neutron per-nucleon channel sum `b = Σ_c G_N(c)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BranchingChannels.a","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BranchingChannels.a","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/branching_qvalue_factorization.lean#L62-L63","doc":"Proton per-nucleon channel sum `a = Σ_c G_P(c)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BranchingChannels.GN","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BranchingChannels.GN","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/branching_qvalue_factorization.lean#L58-L58","doc":"Neutron per-channel weights `G_N(c)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BranchingChannels.GP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BranchingChannels.GP","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/branching_qvalue_factorization.lean#L56-L56","doc":"Proton per-channel weights `G_P(c)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BranchingChannels.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BranchingChannels.mk","kind":"ctor","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/branching_qvalue_factorization.lean#L54-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BranchingChannels","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BranchingChannels","kind":"structure","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/branching_qvalue_factorization.lean#L52-L58","doc":"Per-nucleon `Fin 4`-channel weights for the `β⁻` branching Q-value:\n`GP` for a proton, `GN` for a neutron. ","signatureChunk":0}]}